{"unit_id":"Nrxous__dsh-context7#card-zh","repo":"Nrxous/dsh-context7","commit":"4fdaf40151cb3677ea7a0af849b6af65c85dee03","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-context7（DSH 插件，任意客户端）：把 Context7 软件库文档接入 DSH 模型工具。它注册文档搜索和文档获取工具，并在系统提示中说明适用场景。用户可以按库名搜索并查看匹配结果，也可以按库 ID 或名称获取针对问题整理的文档、代码片段和规则；支持指定版本和快速模式。适合需要查阅最新 API 用法的开发工作。可不配置密钥直接使用；可选 apiKey 用于提高 Context7 的请求速率限制。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:146-222","src/index.js:225-290"]}
{"unit_id":"Nrxous__dsh-context7#card-en","repo":"Nrxous/dsh-context7","commit":"4fdaf40151cb3677ea7a0af849b6af65c85dee03","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-context7 adds Context7 search and documentation tools to DSH. Search by library name, then retrieve relevant docs, code snippets, and rules by ID or name. Pin a version or use fast mode. It helps developers check current API details. An API key is optional and raises request limits.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:146-222","src/index.js:225-290"]}
